title: 'Asset Hub Westend: accept WND teleports from Bulletin Westend'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Bulletin Westend is a sibling parachain outside the system parachain range, so Asset Hub
    Westend did not trust WND teleported from it.
    Asset Hub Westend now trusts WND teleports from Bulletin, and gives Bulletin's accumulation account
    the same explicit unpaid execution as the accumulation accounts of the system parachains.
    This lets Bulletin forward its fees and dust to the DAP staging account with `pallet-accumulate-and-forward`,
    and lets accounts on Bulletin teleport WND back to Asset Hub.
    The Bulletin Westend runtime is built outside this repository, so its accumulation account must use the same
    pallet ID as the other Westend chains.
crates:
- name: asset-hub-westend-runtime
  bump: minor
